ed off with a hint of vanilla and the taste of freshly picked cherries<\/li><li><strong>Wild Berry<\/strong> - A refreshing summer flavour of raspberries, currants & blackberries<\/li><li><strong>Peach<\/strong> - Real peach juice elevated with fresh citrus notes<\/li><li><strong>Strawberry-Rhubarb<\/strong> - Fruity strawberry taste and real rhubarb zing<\/li><li><strong>Aperitivo<\/strong> - Perfect balance of bitter, sweet and juicy<\/li><li><strong>Blood Orange <\/strong>-<strong> <\/strong>Pure Summer feeling thanks to a fruity flavour from red blood oranges<\/li><li><strong>Passion Fruit<\/strong> - Sweet and tangy liqueur with a distinct tropical aroma<\/li><li><strong>High Proof<\/strong> - Triple distilled and filtered, our 50% ABV High Proof Moonshine is one of the smoothest spirits on the market<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products! <\/p>","page":""}},"306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. Most of our products are suitable for vegans and all are safe for those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p><p>Please note: <strong>Tough Nut Cream<\/strong> contains milk and dairy products and is therefore not suitable for vegans or people with dairy allergies.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97","caption","price","description","variant_picker","92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","bffe66cd-99d4-43eb-acd0-9850f187e77f","wishlist_engine_product_page_6VgMdr","collapsible-row-0","32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e","306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128","collapsible-row-2"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"You might also like","heading_size":"h2","products_to_show":4,"columns_desktop":4,"color_scheme":"background-1","image_ratio":"square","show_secondary_image":true,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"grey_sold_out_products":true,"columns_mobile":"2","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":24}},"image_with_text_Bji3WW":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_zPefQM":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"The Perfect Gift","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_ecHDGG":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Our Moonshine is delicious and uniquely presented in our traditional Mason Jars. Treat yourself or a loved one to this unique twist on a classic beverage.<\/p><p>Our Moonshine Giftbox is perfect for birthdays, celebrations or any occasion that calls for a unique twist on a classic spirit.<\/p>","text